---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
---
<BaseLayout title="DMCA & Copyright Takedown Policy" description="How rights holders can report alleged copyright infringement or request removal of a WasmStore game listing." path="/dmca">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">RIGHTS & RESPONSIBLE CURATION</div><h1>DMCA & <span class="gradient-text">takedowns</span></h1><p>A clear route for rights holders to report a listing or request removal.</p></div></section>
  <article class="prose wrap"><p>WasmStore respects intellectual-property rights. Most catalog entries link to third-party demos or source repositories and are not hosted by WasmStore. If you believe a page improperly uses or links to protected material, send a detailed notice so the listing can be reviewed.</p><h2>What to include</h2><ol><li>Your name and contact information, and the rights holder you represent if applicable.</li><li>The exact WasmStore URL(s) you want reviewed.</li><li>Identification of the protected work and a description of the allegedly infringing material.</li><li>The source URL where the material appears, if available.</li><li>A good-faith statement explaining why you believe the use is not authorized.</li><li>A statement that the information in the notice is accurate and that you are authorized to act on behalf of the rights holder.</li></ol><h2>What happens next</h2><p>We will review the notice, investigate the relevant listing, and may disable links or remove material while the matter is assessed. A listing can also be corrected when the issue is a broken link or missing attribution rather than an infringement claim.</p><h2>Submit a notice</h2><p>Use the <a href="/contact">Contact page</a> and select “Copyright / DMCA request.” The production owner must configure a monitored contact email before this process can be considered operational.</p><p><strong>Contact configuration:</strong> <code>{site.contactEmail}</code>. This is a configuration placeholder until replaced with a monitored address.</p><p>This page is an operational template, not legal advice. Have the final policy reviewed for the laws applicable to the site's operator and audience.</p></article>
</BaseLayout>